  "v": 1,
  "note": "Fragments only: no file holds a whole token-shaped value. Join each entry's fragments in order (no separator) at run time. `$SECRET{<id>}` in any fixture is replaced by the joined value of entry <id>. rule = the id of the spec-literals secret_rules (src/assets/handoff-spec.md) that the joined value must hit. part_of = entries whose joined value contains this one (a line or value of a larger secret, for grep checks); a part's class is what it hits alone. class = HARD, WARN or none (a control that must hit nothing). redacted / markers (optional) = BD-2 pins (C-STORE D6): the exact text, or the marker count, after one-marker-per-merged-span redaction with the spec rules (tools/fixtures-gen bd2 check).",
